      "uz_compare": "O'zbekchadagi '-moqchi' ga juda mos: 'ko'chMOQCHIman' = 이사하려고 해요. 'ariza berish UCHUN bordim' = 신청하려고 갔어요.",
      "compare_en": "Like English 'be going to' or 'intend to': 'I'm going to move' = 이사하려고 해요. In the middle of a sentence it means 'in order to'."
