      "uz_compare": "O'zbekchadagi '-ib bermoq' bilan aynan bir xil: 'ko'chirIB BERing' = 옮겨 주세요, 'yordam berdi' = 도와줬어요.",
      "compare_en": "Like English 'for me / for you': 'Move it FOR me' = 옮겨 주세요. Korean builds it into the verb with 주다 ('give')."
